{"title": "Mind Flayer Pod", "pageid": 40001, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Pod", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png/300px-Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png/450px-Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/11/Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png/300px-Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"436\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Mind_Flayer_Pod_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Mind Flayer Pod on the Nautiloid</figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Mind Flayer Pod</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid\">Illithid</a> device which allows mind flayers to keep their captives in order to conduct various experiments on them, including infesting the victim with larvae to create thralls or for further reproducing. Mind Flayer Pods can be found either on a <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a> or in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a>. The pods, as most other illithid devices, are operated by psionic abilities of these creatures - or of the player character's, who from the very start of the game learns to use their tadpole to these ends.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Prologue\">Prologue</span></h3>\n<p>In addition to the player character's own pod, they can find several others in the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nursery room</a> of the prologue. Some are damaged and contain the remains of ill-fated victims, but others are intact and empty, which hints that other captives were able to escape. Interacting with both types of pods bring forth a respective Narrator line.\n</p><p>Exploring the Nautiloid further, the player character can discover several other intact and operational Mind Flayer Pods in other parts of the ship. In a sealed one of the pods <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> is trapped and agreeing to free her initiates <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Illithid%27s_Captive\" title=\"Rescue the Illithid's Captive\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rescue the Illithid's Captive\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Illithid%27s_Captive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rescue the Illithid's Captive\">Rescue the Illithid's Captive</a>. Another pod contains an unknown unconscious woman, who cannot be saved. Instead, interacting with the nearby control panel transform this captive into a newborn mind flayer.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<p>The party can discover two other ruptured, inactive Mind Flayer Pods scattered after Nautiloid crash: one at the <a href=\"/wiki/Ravaged_Beach\" title=\"Ravaged Beach\">Ravaged Beach</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;175&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;274</span> and the other one in the <a href=\"/wiki/Forest\" title=\"Forest\">Forest</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;124&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;376</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The second one belonged to an unknown captive and is located on the bank of a brook flowing towards <a href=\"/wiki/River_Chionthar\" title=\"River Chionthar\">River Chionthar</a>, across the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Two\">Act Two</span></h3>\n<p>A whole bunch of functional Mind Flayer Pods are located in <a href=\"/wiki/Tadpoling_Centre\" title=\"Tadpoling Centre\">Tadpoling Centre</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a>. Some of them are empty, some already keep newly created mind flayers, while others contain characters whom the party has met previously in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/38px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/50px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zevlor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\">Zevlor</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yeva\" title=\"Yeva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/25px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/38px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/50px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gauntlet Yeva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/25px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yeva\" title=\"Yeva\">Gauntlet Yeva</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shuurga\" title=\"Shuurga\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/25px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/38px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/50px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Manip Shuurga\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/25px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shuurga\" title=\"Shuurga\">Manip Shuurga</a>. In the next room with several brine pools is a detached Pod which keeps <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/38px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/50px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mizora\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a>, who had been captured by Absolute cultists.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_locations\">Related locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nautiloid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ravaged_Beach\" title=\"Ravaged Beach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ravaged Beach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Ravaged_Beach\" title=\"Ravaged Beach\">Ravaged Beach</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tadpoling_Centre\" title=\"Tadpoling Centre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tadpoling Centre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Tadpoling_Centre\" title=\"Tadpoling Centre\">Tadpoling Centre</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> The first one may have kept <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/38px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/50px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>, as he stays nearby considering next steps. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> This one may have kept <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> who is on another river bank not far away. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200724\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2627/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16809/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3568/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 7/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3405/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 853496/52428800 bytes\n-->\